{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I keep having to setup Rails environments for people so I am just going to write my first blog article on how to do it on OSX 10.9.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/0424aceda3a531841225fea68ea403fa06bd69c289f71b22cc28a4a9e92e9410.mp3"}, {"text": "Installing the Command line tools", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2a531bcb64b59ff80b26a6de5247dd7d8f86dc99b602026c62901b38f534bf1f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66], [1, 0.66, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 2.0]]}, {"text": "The GCC compiler is required with installing RVM and Brew, so you need to download and install the xcode command line tools.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f43e635e54f5c04c573f3d1ba4aca3ec71e902d1f8efd1ba6f3f1cd28957f2bf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.42], [4, 1.42, 1.76], [5, 1.76, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.54], [7, 2.54, 3.14], [8, 3.14, 3.4], [10, 3.98, 4.2], [11, 4.2, 4.3], [12, 4.3, 4.44], [13, 4.44, 4.62], [14, 4.62, 4.96], [15, 4.96, 5.28], [16, 5.28, 5.62], [17, 5.62, 5.86], [18, 5.86, 6.24], [19, 6.24, 6.5], [20, 6.5, 6.78], [21, 6.78, 7.06]]}, {"text": "Open terminal and type in this:", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/694674e6843d19ee4f777a1ca9cd6133820a1ff7af0fc007a8f23fecec2d1fce.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.72]]}, {"text": "``` console Install Command line tools $ xcode-select –install", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a5ab6cf62ae5bdc7e1893503adc01fe6f1e8ab1213cb84ecfbb0c061e0368207.mp3"}, {"text": "The first command fetches and installs brew.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/fdfb409e8b8b7e3f06272ac72d4df1004209ee4509742fde1ff725b7fc4275a1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.7]]}, {"text": "The second will update brew and fetch the latest installation scripts", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6f23b54e802e1d575b59e1dc25136d0367342485d89004d1fe56dbc84723cc73.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.9], [5, 1.16, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.72], [10, 2.72, 3.12]]}, {"text": "Installing Postgres", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/973a4a9ae848af2714b58b9d577d00d7005bfb7edd5edf6467ebae3097c52764.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66], [1, 0.66, 1.26]]}, {"text": "Most guides recommend installing MySQL as the db engine, but because Heroku defaults to Postgres and Postgres is the hot right now, I use it in dev and in my production environments.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f4aeadb992e47773a2f4056ae3aacae66b07dd754329d0cb699c2d1323b76e43.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.8], [5, 2.44, 2.72], [6, 2.72, 2.82], [7, 2.82, 3.06], [8, 3.06, 3.46], [9, 3.82, 4.22], [10, 4.22, 4.6], [11, 4.6, 4.96], [12, 4.96, 5.58], [13, 5.58, 5.72], [14, 5.72, 6.26], [15, 6.26, 6.58], [16, 6.58, 7.06], [17, 7.06, 7.26], [18, 7.26, 7.4], [19, 7.4, 7.58], [20, 7.58, 7.78], [21, 7.78, 8.06], [22, 8.46, 8.58], [23, 8.58, 8.8], [24, 8.8, 8.94], [25, 8.94, 9.06], [27, 9.26, 9.56], [28, 9.56, 9.68], [29, 9.68, 9.84], [30, 9.84, 10.16], [31, 10.16, 10.8]]}, {"text": "To install, type this command into the terminal:", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6f5e17f3a51e4ba7417961174a372b108da7cfcae6984649204e7e59d2ae061e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.54], [2, 0.76, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.1]]}, {"text": "``` console Installing Postgres $ brew update $ brew install postgresql", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/097e6db48fdbac96e68546a02087285947dad22fcffa7e320f4d6c6f46eaff22.mp3"}, {"text": "Install Rails", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/373ace06d742de810147ed35e3cb255e3935df6a41ce7d1e1399fd81aa0484c7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.8]]}, {"text": "To install the rails toolset type in this to terminal:", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/67b78b150d2d1e37ee196a52d382847b6f6c2cc5aca4452924394598e8690783.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.88], [5, 1.38, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.08]]}, {"text": "``` console Installing Rails $ gem install rails", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4d41524a9e765db73fbe3057d4b4a006ff80c50cb7f259cb38593128802fd207.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.92, 1.4], [5, 1.96, 2.2], [7, 2.64, 3.0]]}, {"text": "Installing Git", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c43cdf13cdf2a680ce2e3f3383f2c52782a27c2c84547f0598676fea67cca5ff.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.54], [1, 0.54, 0.96]]}, {"text": "git is the most common tool for managing source code.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/5e0dde6ce7449bd1a8015c921435103e4fd946cc0261a01f15ccde5d6da7d281.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.62], [7, 1.62, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.66]]}, {"text": "I would recommend creating an account on github and using that as your source control.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/650ecd63c0af3040e0e78f587fdd82a5167b3a9f95ffcd06cab37838044341a2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.7], [10, 2.7, 2.98], [11, 2.98, 3.22], [12, 3.22, 3.34], [13, 3.34, 3.62], [14, 3.62, 3.96]]}, {"text": "Check out these guides for a quick start with git", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/fe942f444860b215b49a313c807c8b63fcbfa7050bf0eeb5bc88e4f7dc97a447.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.16]]}, {"text": "Quick start git guide from the terminal", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/705b996a5c249679d6192c23afe526a42b2d0fcb02dfb84f652fcedecc0a3b8e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [3, 0.62, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.68]]}, {"text": "This is one of the best guides I could find on how to quickly emerse yourself into git.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/19b7920908373c5e0891e56c2c304323765113250615c72d73c9e1e6cd46c2f7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.8], [5, 0.8, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.76], [8, 1.76, 1.9], [9, 1.9, 2.22], [10, 2.22, 2.46], [11, 2.46, 2.6], [12, 2.6, 2.7], [13, 2.7, 2.92], [15, 3.34, 3.6], [16, 3.6, 4.0], [17, 4.0, 4.22]]}, {"text": "Git Guide", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/52219e70f523ecf5a9f040c578ac7e71d2141f5e8e74dbb699545a950f81744d.mp3"}, {"text": "GitHub flow", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ee0e44e01a40af78c1864f089414fd01428c547304c326d8911a1a8e34f30472.mp3"}, {"text": "I uses this pattern for the repo if more than one person is working on it.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/130333edeb7afa25f1c547f23402fdd4458b13dc4dbfa38a5f78809806624450.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [2, 0.4, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.28], [7, 1.62, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.44], [11, 2.44, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.0], [13, 3.0, 3.24], [14, 3.24, 3.44], [15, 3.44, 3.64]]}, {"text": "What is GitFlow?", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2b549072a4974f2e3f4d7d7ea601e6c5034a1279b4be21bec6b35aff7219d90b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.44]]}, {"text": "To install Git CLI", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/136775b1482667e1229eb158209f496990bad20d57a4dc42bdffdd92af937b3e.mp3"}, {"text": "In order to have the most amount of control over your git repo, you will need to install the Git CLI.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e93f1b2e74c279d76a9484b24064f534aacc3bd1e0afa6fd3c47e2a3ea41ed6d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.38], [7, 1.38, 1.54], [8, 1.54, 1.86], [9, 1.86, 2.2], [10, 2.2, 2.42], [12, 2.58, 2.94], [13, 3.24, 3.32], [14, 3.32, 3.42], [15, 3.42, 3.58], [16, 3.58, 3.76], [17, 3.76, 4.12], [18, 4.12, 4.32], [19, 4.32, 4.46], [20, 4.46, 5.04]]}, {"text": "Using the CLI can be intimidating at first, but it is definately worth learning.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ce5bbfee5e8db0a9bfa65470d1798824656c0eb9f6a01d9d3b66183a598d8dce.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.24], [8, 2.5, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.72], [10, 2.72, 2.88], [12, 3.24, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 4.1]]}, {"text": "console Git CLI $ brew update $ brew install git", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/091cd143f6629cff33f349333ca2f021e2b968e7234febc0680d5ba7d2330113.mp3"}, {"text": "To install Github GUI", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c19a3ea69114821cabbd551bd44585780aa23876259fbe17038124515a6fef2b.mp3"}, {"text": "I also use Github’s GUI tool because it makes committing easier.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7557faba34a3c8ba1d310cf00177ebf5ae6ae318bc238975e7bc510845bfd995.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.12], [7, 2.12, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.36]]}, {"text": "Unfortunately it tends to fall flat on its face outside of the happy path (read merge conflicts and rebasing), so you can’t completely rely on this tool for git management.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d5fe75a35c4034073dfb05b3582af864e78822bcc41f2bbe64a0277295c52592.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.74], [1, 1.02, 1.06], [2, 1.06, 1.26], [3, 1.26, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 1.66], [5, 1.66, 2.0], [6, 2.0, 2.14], [9, 2.5, 3.02], [10, 3.02, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.56], [13, 3.56, 4.02], [14, 4.46, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.14], [16, 5.14, 5.56], [17, 5.56, 5.86], [18, 5.86, 6.3], [19, 6.66, 6.86], [20, 6.86, 6.98], [21, 6.98, 7.34], [22, 7.34, 7.7], [23, 7.7, 8.16], [24, 8.16, 8.34], [25, 8.34, 8.54], [26, 8.54, 8.78], [27, 8.78, 9.04], [29, 9.22, 9.64]]}, {"text": "Follow the instructions here Github for mac", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/9d9b6d29e8c032d86c503136dcaa342f6e3b12b44da227773b74cd42a00300a4.mp3"}, {"text": "Install Heroku toolbelt", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/bf2ea8f55a95af7182a10bce9e4766c5c05e7b19a8b3fd6bb11381a31fd90bc2.mp3"}, {"text": "Heroku is a popular hosting service for rails applications, mostly because it is free and easy to use.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2fcc60d43866206378fe354ad527dd132372f9ed278d7a203f684cf16048c5b5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.34], [8, 2.34, 2.92], [10, 3.58, 3.94], [11, 3.94, 4.24], [12, 4.24, 4.36], [13, 4.36, 4.58], [14, 4.58, 4.7], [15, 4.7, 4.94], [16, 4.94, 5.1], [17, 5.1, 5.44]]}, {"text": "Make an account at http://heroku.com/", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/8d636742ad82ff0a69e12b9861a76067494cc198c84c1d2c71a446d9ce9f9761.mp3"}, {"text": "Install the toolbelt found here Heroku Toolbelt", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/cc3939d8d3c8c17e3eee22af32d015a7fea0e8088f48164bdb8db21ecf310959.mp3"}, {"text": "Optional: Installing Sublime", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/acb88f5719b73419db49e6d2d6afbe534896d4ff92c7503dfd7c6ea118389879.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.68], [1, 0.98, 1.38], [2, 1.38, 1.92]]}, {"text": "Sublime is probably the most common text editor for Rails development.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/66bf1d8d4a34a05d82545edad2d4d723234b41ff8436d2c6d677f911ce8a7dd9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 2.74], [9, 2.74, 2.94], [10, 2.94, 3.54]]}, {"text": "You can download it here: Sublime", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/77b543764d56ad2d8cdd36f99bdff5a1215efb431bccc52fe246b362237ead1f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.42]]}]}